[
  {
    "id": "SMM-01",
    "input": {"op": "family", "names": ["Read", "Grep", "WebSearch", "Edit", "NotebookEdit", "Bash", "PowerShell", "KillShell", "mcp__github__get_issue", "Skill", "Agent", "Task", "Workflow", "ToolSearch", "CronDelete", "TodoWrite", "read", "mcp_x"]},
    "expected": {"families": ["explore", "explore", "explore", "edit", "edit", "shell", "shell", "shell", "mcp", "orch", "orch", "orch", "orch", "orch", "orch", "other", "other", "other"]},
    "note": "Family rule: exact names per the table; mcp__ by prefix; TodoWrite is in no list → other; names are case-sensitive (read → other); mcp_x lacks the double underscore → other."
  },
  {
    "id": "SMM-02",
    "input": {"op": "failed", "statuses": ["success", "error", "rejected", "missing"]},
    "expected": {"failed": [false, true, true, false]},
    "note": "Failed rule: only error and rejected are failed; a missing result is not a failure."
  },
  {
    "id": "SMM-03",
    "input": {"op": "perCall", "total": 8, "pricing": {"m": {"in": 1, "out": 1}}, "fallbackModel": null, "firstAt": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "lines": [
      {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "l1", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "message": {"id": "m1", "model": "m", "usage": {"input_tokens": 300000, "output_tokens": 0}, "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "t1", "name": "Read", "input": {}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "t2", "name": "Grep", "input": {}}]}},
      {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "l2", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:01:00.000Z", "message": {"id": "m2", "model": "m", "usage": {"input_tokens": 100000, "output_tokens": 0}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "done"}]}}
    ]},
    "expected": {"events": [
      {"at": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "cost": 3, "toolUseId": "t1"},
      {"at": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "cost": 3, "toolUseId": "t2"},
      {"at": "2026-11-01T10:01:00.000Z", "cost": 2}
    ]},
    "note": "Weights at $1/M: m1 = 0.3, m2 = 0.1, Σ = 0.4. Shares: 8 × 0.3/0.4 = 6, 8 × 0.1/0.4 = 2. m1 has 2 tool_use blocks → 3 each; m2 is text-only → keeps 2 at its own timestamp, no toolUseId. Sum 8 = total."
  },
  {
    "id": "SMM-04",
    "input": {"op": "perCall", "total": 4, "pricing": {"m": {"in": 1, "out": 1}}, "fallbackModel": null, "firstAt": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "lines": [
      {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "l1", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "message": {"id": "m1", "model": "m", "usage": {"input_tokens": 200000, "output_tokens": 0}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "looking"}]}},
      {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "l2", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:00:02.000Z", "message": {"id": "m1", "model": "m", "usage": {"input_tokens": 200000, "output_tokens": 0}, "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "t1", "name": "Read", "input": {}}]}},
      {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "l3", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:02:00.000Z", "message": {"id": "m2", "model": "m", "usage": {"input_tokens": 200000, "output_tokens": 0}, "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "t2", "name": "Bash", "input": {}}]}}
    ]},
    "expected": {"events": [
      {"at": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "cost": 2, "toolUseId": "t1"},
      {"at": "2026-11-01T10:02:00.000Z", "cost": 2, "toolUseId": "t2"}
    ]},
    "note": "Dedup by message.id: lines l1 and l2 are one message m1 (weight = its last usage line, 0.2, not 0.4), placed at its first timestamp 10:00:00, with the tool_use t1 from l2. m2 weighs 0.2. Shares 4 × 0.2/0.4 = 2 each, one tool_use each."
  },
  {
    "id": "SMM-05",
    "input": {"op": "perCall", "total": 5, "pricing": {"m": {"in": 1, "out": 1}}, "fallbackModel": null, "firstAt": "2026-11-01T09:59:00.000Z", "lines": [
      {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "l1", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "message": {"id": "m1", "model": "unpriced-model", "usage": {"input_tokens": 300000, "output_tokens": 0}, "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "t1", "name": "Read", "input": {}}]}}
    ]},
    "expected": {"events": [{"at": "2026-11-01T09:59:00.000Z", "cost": 5}]},
    "note": "The only message's model has no price → weight 0, Σweight = 0, so the whole total 5 sits at the node's first activity 09:59:00 with no toolUseId."
  },
  {
    "id": "SMM-06",
    "input": {"op": "perCall", "total": 6, "pricing": {"m": {"in": 1, "out": 1}}, "fallbackModel": "m", "firstAt": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "lines": [
      {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "l1", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "message": {"id": "m1", "usage": {"input_tokens": 100000, "output_tokens": 100000}, "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "t1", "name": "Edit", "input": {}}]}},
      {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "l2", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:00:30.000Z", "message": {"id": "m2", "usage": {"input_tokens": 100000, "output_tokens": 0}, "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "t2", "name": "Bash", "input": {}}]}}
    ]},
    "expected": {"events": [
      {"at": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "cost": 4, "toolUseId": "t1"},
      {"at": "2026-11-01T10:00:30.000Z", "cost": 2, "toolUseId": "t2"}
    ]},
    "note": "No message names a model, so both are priced with the fallback model m: m1 = 0.1 + 0.1 = 0.2, m2 = 0.1, Σ = 0.3. Shares 6 × 0.2/0.3 = 4 and 6 × 0.1/0.3 = 2."
  },
  {
    "id": "SMM-07",
    "input": {"op": "perCall", "total": 0, "pricing": {"m": {"in": 1, "out": 1}}, "fallbackModel": null, "firstAt": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "lines": [
      {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "l1", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "message": {"id": "m1", "model": "m", "usage": {"input_tokens": 100000, "output_tokens": 0}, "content": []}}
