    "expected": {"events": []},
    "note": "A node whose priced total is 0 gets no cost events."
  },
  {
    "id": "SMM-08",
    "input": {"op": "model", "pricing": {"m": {"in": 1, "out": 1}},
      "main": [
        {"type": "user", "uuid": "u0", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:00:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "go"}},
        {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "a0", "parentUuid": "u0", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:00:10.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg-main", "role": "assistant", "model": "m", "usage": {"input_tokens": 1000000, "output_tokens": 0}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ok"}]}}
      ],
      "subagents": [
        {"sessionId": "agent-a", "parentSessionId": null, "workflowRunId": null, "logs": [
          {"type": "user", "uuid": "ua", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:01:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "task a"}},
          {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "aa", "parentUuid": "ua", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:01:05.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg-a", "role": "assistant", "model": "m", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2000000, "output_tokens": 0}, "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "r1", "name": "Read", "input": {"file_path": "src/a.ts"}}]}}
        ]},
        {"sessionId": "agent-b", "parentSessionId": null, "workflowRunId": null, "logs": [
          {"type": "user", "uuid": "ub", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:02:00.000Z", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "task b"}},
          {"type": "assistant", "uuid": "ab", "parentUuid": "ub", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:02:05.000Z", "message": {"id": "msg-b", "role": "assistant", "model": "m", "usage": {"input_tokens": 500000, "output_tokens": 0}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "done"}]}}
        ]}
      ],
      "stats": {"agent-a": {"model": "m", "inputTokens": 3000000}}
    },
    "expected": {"mainCost": 1, "agentCosts": {"a": 3, "b": 0.5}, "treeCost": 4.5, "costAtEnd": 4.5},
    "note": "Main = its own 1M input tokens at $1/M = 1. Agent a has a stats row (3M tokens) → 3, not its transcript's 2. Agent b has none → its transcript's 0.5M = 0.5. Tree = 1 + 3 + 0.5 = 4.5. Every cost event lies at or before the last activity 10:02:05, so the cumulative cost at the end (counters and last timeline bin) is the tree total 4.5."
  },
  {
    "id": "SMM-09",
    "input": {"op": "timeline", "start": 0, "end": 5400000, "nodes": [
      {"costEvents": [{"t": 0, "cost": 1}, {"t": 5400000, "cost": 2}]},
      {"costEvents": [{"t": 2700000, "cost": 5}]}
    ]},
    "expected": {"binCount": 120, "lastCumulative": 8, "tickStepMin": 30, "ticks": [0, 1800000, 3600000, 5400000]},
    "note": "120 bins. Cumulative at the end = 1 + 2 + 5 = 8 (the event at the end falls in the last bin). Span 90 min: step 5 gives 19 ticks, 10 gives 10, 30 gives 4 ≤ 8 → 30 min: 0, 30, 60, 90 min."
  },
  {
    "id": "SMM-10",
    "input": {"op": "timeline", "start": 0, "end": 1800000, "nodes": [
      {"costEvents": [{"t": 600000, "cost": 0.25}]}
    ]},
    "expected": {"binCount": 120, "lastCumulative": 0.25, "tickStepMin": 5, "ticks": [0, 300000, 600000, 900000, 1200000, 1500000, 1800000]},
    "note": "Span 30 min: step 5 gives floor(30/5) + 1 = 7 ≤ 8 ticks → 5 min."
  },
  {
