    "expected": {"columns": [
      {"key": "wf-W2", "label": "build · run #1", "rootIds": ["d"]},
      {"key": "wf-W1", "label": "review · run #2", "rootIds": ["a", "b"]},
      {"key": "direct", "label": "Agents spawned by the main session", "rootIds": ["c"]}
    ], "nested": {}},
    "note": "Workflow columns by earliest start: W2 (1200) before W1 (min 2000, 1500 = 1500); run #index is the position among workflow columns. The direct column is last although c started first (1000). Roots keep input order (a, b)."
  },
  {
