      {"key": "wf-R7", "label": "workflow run", "rootIds": ["g"]}
    ], "nested": {}},
    "note": "No run has a wfId, so every column is keyed by workflowRunId and labelled from the running runs in toolUseId order (tu-a lint, tu-b deploy) by start rank: R8 (100) → lint, R9 (200) → deploy; R7 (300) has no running run left → 'workflow run'."
  },
  {
    "id": "SMM-13",
    "input": {"op": "group",
      "agents": [
        {"agentId": "p", "parentId": null, "workflowRunId": "W1", "startMs": 100},
        {"agentId": "q", "parentId": "p", "workflowRunId": null, "startMs": 150},
        {"agentId": "r", "parentId": "q", "workflowRunId": "W5", "startMs": 50}
