    "expected": {"counters": {"elapsedMs": 120, "costSoFar": 15, "costTotal": 15, "agentsStarted": 2, "agentsTotal": 2, "calls": 4, "failed": 2}},
    "note": "At the end t = 120 (inclusive): cost 1 + 2 + 4 + 8 = 15 = the tree total; calls 10, 50, 30, 120 = 4; failed at 50 and 120 = 2; both agents started."
  },
  {
