    "note": "Card label rule: agent a has the description 'Review billing', which wins over its prompt 'task a'; agent b has none, so its label is its cleaned prompt 'task b'. Labelling from the prompt only would give a = 'task a'. Costs: main 1M → 1, a 2M → 2, b 0.5M → 0.5 (no stats rows), tree 3.5, all events by 10:02:05 so the cost at the end is 3.5."
  }
